@startuml
title Quote Preparation. Validation & Approval

box "Mobile Network Operator"
participant "Product Order Capture & Validation;\nProduct Order Delivery\nOrchestration and Mgmt\n(for Business Partner)" as MNO_POC
participant "Delegate\nExposure" as MNO_DE
end box

box "Satellite Network Operator"
participant "Delegate\nExposure" as SNO_DE
participant "Product Configurator" as ProdConfig
participant "Product Order Capture\n& Validation" as SNO_POC
participant "Product Catalog\nManagement" as ProductCatalogMgmt
participant "Product Inventory" as ProductInv
participant "Location\nManagement" as LocationMgmt
participant "Service Qualification\nManagement" as ServiceQualMgmt
end box

participant "Resource systems:\nBeam Planning\nTeleport Mgmt\nCapacity Mgmt\nRegulatity DB" as ResourceSystems

note over MNO_POC
  Based on received Intitial Quote data
  and "provide additional info" details
  interacts with other systems and parties
  to build Quote Update Request
end note

MNO_POC -> MNO_DE : 35. TMF648 Quote\nPATCH /quote/{id}\nState="In Progress"\n(instantSyncQuote=false\nquoteItem list:\n{quoteItem.id="NTN-Wholesale-001",\nproduct.productCharacteristic (UL/DL Ratio = 0.1)},\n{quoteItem.id="NTN-Cell-12",\nproduct.productCharacteristic (Service Area = SA-234),\nquoteItemRelationship( depends on quoteItem.id="Cell-Pipe-12" )},\n{quoteItem.id="NTN-Teleport-EP-12"\nproduct.productCharacteristic (Preferred Teleport = NTN-TI)\nquoteItemRelationship( depends on quoteItem.id="Cell-Pipe-12")},...)
MNO_DE -> SNO_DE : 36. TMF648 Quote\nPATCH /quote/{id} (forwarded)
SNO_DE -> ProdConfig : 37. TMF648 Quote\nPATCH /quote/{id} (forwarded)

note right of ProdConfig
  TMF648 Quote for items with updated information:
  QuoteItem[x].State="In Progress"
end note

ProdConfig -> ProdConfig : 38. TMF760 Product Configuration\nPOST /queryProductConfiguration\n(.,contextEntity = <quote id>,\nrequestProductConfigurationItem list)\n(full Quote including updated and added quote Items)

alt resolve places refs from provided Area location labels
ProdConfig -> LocationMgmt : 39. TMF673 Geographic Address\nGET /geographicAddress?(...id="SA-234"...)
LocationMgmt --> ProdConfig : 40. TMF673 Geographic Address\n200 OK (list of places)
else resolve places refs from Area shape data
ProdConfig -> LocationMgmt : 41. TMF675 Geographic Location\nGET /geographicLocation?\n(type="polygon",\n"coordinates": [[20,30],[20,35],[20,40],[10,30],[30,10]])
LocationMgmt --> ProdConfig : 42. TMF675 Geographic Location\n200 OK (list of places)
end

note over ProdConfig
  Performs checks and calculation:
  Validate provided by Buyer Inputs
  Calculate Aggregate capacity for Tier
  Check Discounts eligibility
  If any data yet to be collected from Buyer
end note

ProdConfig -> ProdConfig : 43. TMF760 Product Configuration\n200 OK\n(State=Done\nList of computedProductConfigurationItem\n(Fully Configured Quote Item))
note right of ProdConfig : Combined Response for all Quote Items

note over ProdConfig
  Prepare for
  Technical Feasibility and
  Service Qualification:
  Beam steering feasibility for service area polygon
  Cell breathing tolerance
  Capacity headroom per beam
  Geo-restrictions at cell level
  SLA deliverability for requested performance tier
end note

ProdConfig -> ServiceQualMgmt : 44. TMF645 Service Qulification\nPOST /checkServiceQualification

note over ServiceQualMgmt
  Orchestrate checks:
  Teleport link allocation
  Teleport endpoint availability
  Satellite beam steering feasibility
  Cell breathing tolerance
  Capacity headroom
  SLA deliverability
  Regulatory/geo feasibility
end note

ServiceQualMgmt <-> ResourceSystems : 45. Technical Feasibility and\nService Qualification

ServiceQualMgmt --> ProdConfig : 46. TMF645 Service Qulification\n201 Created\n(qualificationResult=qualified)

note right of ProdConfig
  TMF648 Quote
  Update Quote with SQ result
  prepare for final price recalculation
end note

ProdConfig -> ProdConfig : 47. TMF760 Product Configuration\nPOST /queryProductConfiguration\n(.,contextEntity = <quote id>,\nrequestProductConfigurationItem list)\n(full Quote including updated after SQ quote Items)

note over ProdConfig
  Performs final calculation
  Apply aggregate discounts
end note

ProdConfig -> ProdConfig : 48. TMF760 Product Configuration\n200 OK
ProdConfig -> ProdConfig : 49. TMF760 Product Configuration\nPOST /checkProductConfiguration (Fully Configured Quote)

note over ProdConfig : Check, Validate, Approve

ProdConfig -> ProdConfig : 50. TMF760 Product Configuration\n200 OK\n([checkProductConfigurationItem(State=Approved)])

note right of ProdConfig
  TMF648 Quote
  update Quote (State=Approved)
  Trigger Buyer Acceptance of Quote
end note

ProdConfig --> SNO_DE : 51. TMF648 Quote\n200 OK\nState="Approved"\nFully configured Quote
SNO_DE --> MNO_DE : 52. TMF648 Quote\n200 OK\nState="Approved"\nFully configured Quote
MNO_DE --> MNO_POC : 53. TMF648 Quote\n200 OK\nState="Approved"\nFully configured Quote

note over MNO_POC
  Gets final procurement approval,
  Gets final technical validation,
  Triggers teleport links prepartaion,
  Triggers preparation of operational environment
  and configuration to support the future service
end note

MNO_POC -> MNO_DE : 54. TMF648 Quote\nPATCH /quote/{id}\nState="Accepted"
MNO_DE -> SNO_DE : 55. TMF648 Quote\nPATCH /quote/{id}\nState="Accepted"
SNO_DE -> ProdConfig : 56. TMF648 Quote\nPATCH /quote/{id}\nState="Accepted"

note right of ProdConfig
  TMF648 Quote
  update Quote (State=Accepted)
end note

ProdConfig --> SNO_DE : 57. TMF648 Quote\n200 OK
SNO_DE --> MNO_DE : 58. TMF648 Quote\n200 OK
MNO_DE --> MNO_POC : 59. TMF648 Quote\n200 OK
@enduml
